          <h3>Take the history</h3>
          <p>Adaptive questions, one at a time.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" role="img" aria-label="Rules check icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M16 4 27 8v7c0 7-4.5 11-11 14C9.5 26 5 22 5 15V8l11-4Z" fill="none" stroke="#0F4C3A" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="m10.5 16 3.5 3.5 7.5-8" fill="none" stroke="#0F4C3A" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Check for danger signs</h3>
          <p>A rules file, not the AI, decides urgency.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" role="img" aria-label="Structured note icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M9 4.5h10l5 5V27H9V4.5Z" fill="none" stroke="#0F4C3A" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M19 4.5v5h5M12.5 15h8M12.5 19.5h8M12.5 24h5" stroke="#0F4C3A" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Get a clear note</h3>
          <p>A structured clerking note and a plain-language summary for the clinician to review.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="safety-wrap shell" id="about" aria-labelledby="safety-title">
      <div class="safety">
        <h2 id="safety-title">Built to be careful</h2>
        <ul class="safety-grid">
          <li>QuickHealth never diagnoses.</li>
          <li>Urgency is decided by a rules file.</li>
          <li>Completeness and contradiction checks run before a note is finished.</li>
          <li>This prototype uses fictional cases only.</li>
          <li>The rules have not yet been reviewed by a clinician.</li>
          <li>QuickHealth is not medical advice.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="safety-alert">If someone has danger signs, call emergency services.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
