            <path d="M58 116c11-15 26-27 47-38" fill="none" stroke="#0F4C3A" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
          <p>Clear questions. Careful notes.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="art-caption">Made for health workers</span>
