      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pathways section" aria-labelledby="pathway-title">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2 id="pathway-title">Support for every stage</h2>
          <p>Focused pathways help gather the details that matter for a clear clinical history.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-grid">
          <article class="path-card path-card--mother" id="mothers">
            <span class="icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" role="img" aria-label="Pregnancy and postnatal pathway icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M16 27s-9-5.6-9-12.5C7 9.8 12.5 8 16 13c3.5-5 9-3.2 9 1.5C25 21.4 16 27 16 27Z" fill="none" stroke="#0F4C3A" stroke-width="2.3"/><path d="M14 18c.2-3.6 2.7-5.8 6.5-5.8-.5 3.8-2.8 5.8-6.5 5.8Z" fill="#0F4C3A"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Pregnancy and postnatal pathway</h3>
